=3D"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents"><h1 id=3D"read-the-last-line=
-first">=E2=96=B6=EF=B8=8F Read the Last Line First</h1>
<span class=3D"paragraph">When a cell fails, marimo shows Python's error me=
ssage under it.</span>
<span class=3D"paragraph">Add a cell with <code>freight_charges[5]</code> a=
nd run it. You get an <code>IndexError</code>.</span>
<span class=3D"paragraph">The <strong>last line</strong> names the error an=
d states what went wrong: <code>list index out of range</code>. The list ha=
s five items, at positions 0 to 4, so position 5 does not exist. The lines =
